<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 100-5 IN 2ND INNINGS V GLAMORGAN - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 100-5 IN 2ND INNINGS V GLAMORGAN - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, 115 runs ahead on first innings, were 100 for five in their second innings at the close on the second day of the three-day tour match against Glamorgan on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 369-4 declared and 100-5, Glamorgan 254 all out.</p>
